        <fullName>Broker_Case_Management_16jHn0000010zDe</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Handles the creation and tracking of support cases related to booking, payment plans, commissions, leads, portal issues, and general support inquiries.

This topic is used to address Broker reports of issue related to  booking of a Unit, issue related to payment plans of Unit, issue related to commission of a Unit, issue in creating lead , issue related to Broker portal , and general support issue.</description>
        <developerName>Broker_Case_Management_16jHn0000010zDe</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Handle support requests when the user mentions problems, issues, complaints, unit booking issues, payment plan issues related to a unit, commission-related issues for a unit, lead creation, broker portal issues, or general support requests.

If the user reports an issue while booking a unit, ask for the Unit Name and pass it to the Apex class.
Unit Record IDs start with a44
Unit names follow formats like A-101, A-102

If the user reports an issue with a booked unit, ask for the Booking Unit Name and pass it to the Apex class. Booking Unit Record IDs start with a3A.  Booking Unit names follow formats like Booking Unit - 2026-05-13, Booking Unit - 2026-05-12

Do not get confused in UNIT and Booking Unit (Booked Unit) both are different.

For requests related to:
Unit Booking
Payment Plans
Commission-related issues
first collect the Unit Name from the user, then call the action ‘Create Broker Case’.
For requests related to:
Lead creation
Broker portal issues
General support cases
ask for:
Type
Subject
Description
Any other required details
and then call the Apex action ‘Create Broker Case’.

Before triggering any action:

Gather all required information by asking clarifying questions.
Summarize and confirm the details with the user.
Only proceed with the action after the user confirms with responses such as “yes”, “ok”, “proceed”, or similar confirmation.</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1779274658537</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1779274658537</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>For case creation, collect only the missing required details. Ask one question at a time and do not guess missing information. The required case details are:

Issue Type
Subject
Description</description>
